            <div class="ember-card legal-content">
                <h1 style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Terms of Service</h1>
                <p class="ember-text-muted">Last updated: January 2025</p>

                <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
                <p>
                    By using CertiFriedUtility ("the Service"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service.
                    If you do not agree to these terms, do not use the Service.
                </p>

                <h2>2. Age Requirement</h2>
                <p>
                    <strong>You must be at least 18 years of age to use CertiFriedUtility.</strong>
                    This service is designed for adult cannabis community discussions.
                    By using the Service, you confirm that you are 18 or older.
                </p>

                <h2>3. Service Description</h2>
                <p>
                    CertiFriedUtility is a chat bot for Twitch and Kick platforms that provides cannabis-themed
                    community engagement features including:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Toke tracking and counters</li>
                    <li>Daily rewards with streak bonuses</li>
                    <li>Smoke session coordination</li>
                    <li>Leaderboards and statistics</li>
                    <li>Strain information lookup</li>
                    <li>Cannabis trivia games</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>4. User Responsibilities</h2>

                <h3>4.1 Legal Compliance</h3>
                <p>You agree to:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Comply with all applicable laws regarding cannabis in your jurisdiction</li>
                    <li>Not use the Service to promote illegal activity</li>
                    <li>Not use the Service in jurisdictions where cannabis is illegal</li>
                    <li>Take full responsibility for your actions and local law compliance</li>
                </ul>

                <h3>4.2 Platform Rules</h3>
                <p>You agree to:</p>
