                    <li>Comply with Twitch and Kick Terms of Service</li>
                    <li>Not use the bot to spam, harass, or abuse other users</li>
                    <li>Not attempt to exploit or abuse bot functionality</li>
                    <li>Not use the Service for commercial purposes without permission</li>
                </ul>

                <h3>4.3 Account Security</h3>
                <p>
                    You are responsible for maintaining the security of your connected accounts.
                    You must not share your OAuth tokens or allow unauthorized access.
                </p>

                <h2>5. Bring Your Own Bot Model</h2>
                <p>
                    CertiFriedUtility uses a "Bring Your Own Bot" model where you authorize your own
                    Twitch/Kick account. By connecting your account, you:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Grant us permission to read and send messages on your behalf</li>
                    <li>Accept responsibility for messages sent through your account</li>
                    <li>Agree that your username may appear on public leaderboards</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>6. Intellectual Property</h2>
