                    CertiFriedUtility and its original content, features, and functionality are owned by
                    CertiFried MultiTool. You may not copy, modify, or distribute our service
                    without permission.
                </p>

                <h2>7. User Content</h2>
                <p>
                    Statistics, leaderboard entries, and other user-generated data may be displayed
                    publicly. You retain ownership of your original content but grant us a license
                    to display it as part of the Service.
                </p>

                <h2>8. Disclaimers</h2>

                <h3>8.1 No Medical Advice</h3>
                <p>
                    <strong>CertiFriedUtility does not provide medical advice.</strong> Strain information and
                    other content are for entertainment purposes only. Always consult a healthcare
