                </p>

                <h3>8.3 Third-Party Platforms</h3>
                <p>
                    We are not responsible for Twitch or Kick platform issues, including service
                    outages, API changes, or account suspensions.
                </p>

                <h2>9. Limitation of Liability</h2>
                <p>
                    To the maximum extent permitted by law, CertiFried MultiTool and its operators
                    shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or
                    punitive damages arising from your use of the Service.
                </p>

                <h2>10. Termination</h2>
                <p>We may terminate or suspend your access to the Service at any time, for any reason, including:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Violation of these Terms</li>
                    <li>Abuse of the Service</li>
                    <li>At our sole discretion</li>
                </ul>
                <p>
                    You may terminate your use at any time by disconnecting the bot from your channel
                    and stopping use of bot commands.
                </p>

                <h2>11. Changes to Terms</h2>
                <p>
                    We reserve the right to modify these Terms at any time. Continued use of the
                    Service after changes constitutes acceptance of the new Terms.
                </p>

                <h2>12. Governing Law</h2>
                <p>
